    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;By virtue of its flat roof design, its scale and siting, the proposed two-storey extension would provide for visually dominating and overbearing addition, which lacks subservience to the host dwelling and is of poor visual amenity value. This is considered harmful to the overall character and appearance of no. 30 Essex Road and is therefore contrary to the aims and objectives of Policy 53 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
